===Abilities===
YuruGeGe contained most abilities from The Battle Cats, but also introduced an array of new abilities. For more information about all abilities in YuruGeGe, see [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%A5%AD%A5%E3%A5%E9%A5%AF%A5%BF%A1%BC%A4%CE%C6%C3%BC%EC%C0%AD%C7%BD here].

