|Rebirth<br>(転生 ''Tensei'')
|[[File:Rebirth.png|center|50px]]
|Upon reaching 0 HP, a specific other unit of the same level/strength magnification would spawn at the site of the user's death. Most playable characters with this ability were Evolved/[[True Form]] units that would spawn their Normal Form upon death, while enemies were usually bosses/mini-bosses with multiple phases.<br>Some stages applied this property to enemies that didn't actually have the Rebirth ability. For example, the stage [https://youtu.be/_1Fy1GuJke8 Mutenka Sanmyaku] (無添加山脈, "Additive-free Mountains") was unique for having three [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%B5%ED%B5%B4 Gyūki] that turned into different traited Gyūki variants when defeated. The first turned into the Metal [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%A5%B8%A5%E5%A5%A6%A5%AD Jūki], the second became the Hercules [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%b5%ed%b3%d1%b5%b4 Gyū-Kaku-Oni], and the last was reborn as the Abyss [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%b1%af%cb%e2%b2%a6 Ushi-Maō].
|-
|Vain Struggle<br>(わるあがき ''Waruagaki'')
|[[File:Vain Struggle.png|center|50px]]
