|Buffed the recharge time of all allied characters of certain types. For example, [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%B0%AA%28%C2%E85%B4%FC%29 Series 5 Yuki-Onna Aoi] decreased the recharge time of all [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/t/%C0%E3%BD%F7%C2%B2 Yuki-Onna Tribe units] by 5 seconds.
|-
|Great Witchcraft Initial Gauge Up<br>(大妖術初期ゲージアップ ''Dai Yōjutsu Shoki Gēji Appu'')
|[[File:Great Witchcraft Initial Gauge Up.png|center|50px]]
|Allowed Great Witchcraft (the [[Cat Cannon]]'s equivalent) to start with its gauge already filled up. For example, [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%a5%e6%a5%e1%a5%b3 Yumeko] allowed it to start 50% full.
|-
|Soul Level Initial Value Up<br>(魂レベル初期値アップ ''Tamashī Reberu Shokichi Appu'')
|[[File:Soul Level Initial Value Up.png|center|50px]]
|Allowed Soul Level (the [[Worker Cat]]'s equivalent) to start already leveled up, with an upper limit of 2. All units with this ability increased the starting level by 1.
|-
|Soul Amount Initial Value Up<br>(魂量初期値アップ ''Tamashi-ryō Shokichi Appu'')
|[[File:Soul Amount Initial Value Up.png|center|50px]]
|Allowed the player to start with some soul (money) already available to use. For example, [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%A5%CF%A5%ED%A5%A6%A5%A3%A5%F3%A5%B6%A5%F3%A5%D3%A5%A2 Halloween Zambia] increased the player's starting soul by 500.
|-
|Soul Upper Limit Up<br>(魂上限値アップ ''Tanashī Jōgen-chi Appu'')
|[[File:Soul Upper Limit Up.png|center|50px]]
|Increased soul capacity (wallet size) by a set percentage, with an upper limit of 10%. All units with this ability increased max soul by 5%.
|-
|Secret Art<br>(秘術 ''Hijutsu'')
|[[File:Secret Art.png|center|50px]]
|Equivalent to [[Surge Attack]]s. Unlike Surges, Secret Arts could have different effects/abilities and damage values from the attack that created them, as well as different designs and animations depending on the unit.
|-
|Immune to Secret Arts<br>(秘術無効 ''Hijutsu Mukō'')
|[[File:Immune to Secret Arts.png|center|50px]]
|Equivalent to Immune to Surge. Prevented Secret Arts from damaging the user.
|-
|Immune to Great Witchcraft<br>(大妖術無効 ''Dai Yōjutsu Mukō'')
|[[File:Immune to Great Witchcraft.png|center|50px]]
|Units with this ability were unaffected by Great Witchcraft. For playable characters, this meant they were unaffected by animated enemy bases. For enemy characters, this meant they were unaffected by the Cat Cannon's equivalent.
|-
|Resist Great Witchcraft<br>(大妖術軽減 ''Dai Yōjutsu Keigen'')
|[[File:Resist Great Witchcraft.png|center|50px]]
|Reduced the damage its user took from animated enemy bases by a set percentage. Unlike Immune to Great Witchcraft, no enemies had this ability.
|}

